SUMMARY:Saxapahaw Island Park Invasive Removal (Graham)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter for an invasive plant removal at Saxapahaw Island Park. Volunteers will help remove Chinese privet and other invasive plants on the island. This is a chance to restore a unique bottomland forest habitat on an island in the Haw River!  \nREGISTER HERE
