SUMMARY:Rooted and Resilient: Celebrating the Power of Native Trees for Wildlife (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Join National Wildlife Federation for a virtual celebration of our decades-long achievement of bringing communities together to plant and care for more than 620\,000 native trees through Trees for Wildlife™ \nDuring this event\, we will reflect on the value and importance of native trees\, share inspiring stories of how our work has impacted wildlife and communities\, and recognize the thousands of staff\, volunteers\, partners\, and supporters who help support healthy\, sustainable\, wildlife-friendly communities. \nCelebrate with us and learn more about the stories behind the impact with our special guest speakers from Tennessee Environmental Council and the North Carolina Wildlife Federation.\n \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/rooted-and-resilient-trees/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
