SUMMARY:Brumley Rewilding Oasis Restoration (Chapel Hill)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter for an oasis maintenance workday! The chapter worked hard to plant and fence native plant oases in Brumley Preserve South. Now comes the important work of stewarding and maintaining the native saplings in these oases. Volunteers will help water these saplings and remove invasive plants that are encroaching on the oases. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/brumley-rewilding-oasis/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
