SUMMARY:Grandfather Mountain Junior Hawk Watch (Linville)
DESCRIPTION:Join Grandfather Mountain Stewardship Foundation and NCWF High Country Wild Wildlings Program for a popup program to identify hawks in flight during fall migration. Binoculars and resources will be provided. You don’t have to be an expert in bird ID to volunteer for this. You just need to be excited to look for birds and help kids learn to use binoculars and field guides! No registration required \nLEARN MORE
