DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Lower Cape Fear Wildlife and dozens of other environmental organizations for a stewarship fair. Learn about your local wildlife and landscape and what steps you can take to preserve it. All are welcome! Event kicks off with a showing of “Shew’s Natural Treasures” with UNCW’s Roger Shew. \nFIND OUT MORE
