SUMMARY:Native Bee Presentation and Demonstrations (Mint Hill)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF HAWK chapter as we delve into the world of native bees and learn about the over 500 species of wild bees in NC. Learn more about the importance of pollinators and go outside together with some nets to carefully catch some bees to get a closer look! \nREGISTER HERE
