SUMMARY:Antioch Bay Workday (Red Springs)
DESCRIPTION:Join TNC to celebrate the 10th anniversary of Antioch Bay’s designation as a Wetland Treasure by helping improve the ecosystem! Come explore this unique landscape and remove encroaching species using loppers\, pruners\, and hand-removal. \nREGISTER HERE
